# Pairs with UnconfirmableDenies. With the snapshot not authoritative and the
# registry unreachable the enforcer must deny; the mutant falls back to the
# snapshot.
MODULE: DecideTrustsUnconfirmable
TARGET: UnconfirmableDenies
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a request that cannot be confirmed trusts the snapshot
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
              ELSE [kind |-> "deny", auth |-> FALSE, reach |-> FALSE]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: fail open.
              ELSE [kind |-> "trust", auth |-> FALSE, reach |-> FALSE]
--- END
